{
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Kiketsu Family, the Keiga Family,",
                "and the Gouyoku Alliance..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Phew, what a busy tube-fox I am."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heyyyyy, Sanae!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Miss Tsukasa, what can I do for you today?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Won't you lend me the shrine? Just for a bit."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "U-um, what for?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I want to make it a base for the beast youkai of the mountain.",
                "You’ll let me do that, won’t you, Sanae?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't be silly!",
                "Why would we ever..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Regardless, we don’t have a moment to lose."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "At this rate, we’ll be overrun ",
                "by those weird beast youkai."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just about to go investigate myself."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But still, I can’t just lend you our shrine."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Have a good day!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine is not up for grabs."
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Keiga Family can't be relied on.",
                "They've got nothing between the ears."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I'm certain the Gouyoku Alliance will ",
                "tear themselves apart. So that just leaves..."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As expected, it's going to be the Kiketsu Family.",
                "Their ideology suits me just fine too."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\tYou're a \t,\ttube-fox?\t,lowly fox?",
                "You're a tube-fox?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, now.",
                "Aren't you that fox who can't hide her tails?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is someone like you doing at the Moriya Shrine?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sanae told me she was busy, so I'm",
                "house-sitting in her absence."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "House-sitting...? It didn't seem like that,",
                "the way Sanae spoke about it."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I shouldn't put much faith",
                "in the words of a tube-fox."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My, how upsetting.",
                "Even though dear Sanae asked me to."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Send away any suspicious trespassers, she said."
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's nothing fun about two foxes",
                "bamboozling each other in a place like this..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you investigating the incident?",
                "You've been wasting your time here then."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you're looking for people who are up to no good,",
                "you should delve into the Underworld."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's nowhere to hide up on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "142_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...It looks like she bought it.",
                "That's good."
            ]
        },
        "150_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Gouyoku Alliance is the biggest concern.",
                "|\tLet that stuck-up \t,\tnine-tails\t,the one just now",
                "Let that stuck-up nine-tails deal with them."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you were trying to gain something",
                "from this incident, where would you hide?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There used to be a sanctuary for spirits around here,",
                "but an animal ate them all and awakened as a youkai."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That sounds like the Kiketsu Family's work."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If I want to get in good with the Kiketsu Family,",
                "I just have to win that guy over."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A fox...?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I work for your boss.",
                "Running errands."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, so you are the one Lady Yachie spoke of.",
                "|\tA \t,\ttube-fox\t,spy",
                "A tube-fox, are you?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah... I just thought I should stop by",
                "and introduce myself..."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard a mountain monkey was driven out of their pack,",
                "and awoke by eating this sanctuary's spirits..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Shush! I told the Family I was born from a stone",
                "that was struck by a thunderbolt!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From now on, spread this story, alright?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay, okay."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And besides, I have no reason to confide in you."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those who only run their mouths can't be trusted.",
                "That's what I believe."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm hm hm, so you want to see if I'm all talk?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So—have we reached an understanding?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's not that. Pay attention."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I had to put a stop to our battle."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Someone hunting for you is approaching us."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...All right, I'll figure something out."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you are all talk."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is it safe over this way?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aagh, I'm so tired.",
                "I'll just have a little break."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, you."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What were you doing, speaking so intimately with",
                "the new blood from the Kiketsu Family?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could it be, you're going back on your promises to",
                "|\t\t,\tthe Keiga family\t,us",
                "the Keiga family...?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not at all, you've got the wrong idea.",
                "That monkey was just picking a fight with me."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was only looking into the movements of the Kiketsu Family and",
                "the Gouyoku Alliance, like you requested."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh heh heh."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, it's fine.",
                "Even if you're betraying us."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you saying it's fine if I betray you?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Punishing traitors is also enjoyable."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hahahah."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\tIsn't that right, \t,\ttube-fox\t,double dealer",
                "Isn't that right, tube-fox?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you really believe your connection to the",
                "Kiketsu Family would go unnoticed?!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "H-hey, it's just a misunderstandingǃ"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Finding out what the Kiketsu Family are up to,",
                "that was the job you gave me."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So I have to get an in with the Kiketsu Family.",
                "That's to be expected, right?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, of course, of course."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, yes, you're so level-headed."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In that case, you can continue your investigations."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This time, the target is a little unusual...",
                "But I'm sure you can handle it."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll be taking back your advance fee!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So it's not the Kiketsu Family or the Gouyoku Alliance,",
                "but some other group I'm looking into?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That Saki could easily bump me off.",
                "Lying to her was a bad idea after all."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She must be sending me to Hell to silence me.",
                "That much is obvious."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now she suspects that I am a double agent.",
                "What to do, what to do..."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my, welcome to Hell."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No matter who, no matter when,",
                "all are welcome in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "W-who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am Hisami Yomotsu.",
                "A guide of Hell."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, where would you like to go today?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, em, well."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Right, I came to investigate the incident on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, that said, it has nothing to do with Hell right?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ho-hoh, this is a surprise."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's still so soon, and yet, there are people who have",
                "traced this incident back to Hell already."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then allow me to guide you to the one you seek.",
                "But first..."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In keeping the spirit of Hell,",
                "I'm going to <b$make> you a spirit of Hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aaaaah!",
                "Such splendid strength."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, I shall guide you into Hell."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, maybe not into Hell..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Were you thinking of going home?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Or rather, did you think you <i$could> go home?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those who have fallen into Hell",
                "may never leave by their own power."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It would not be much of a prison otherwise,",
                "would it?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fuuuu..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is this?",
                "I waited so long only to be disappointed."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Haaaa, it's over for me."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place is certainly Hell."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O Tube-fox."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You stand before Zanmu Nippaku."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have been watching you from the very beginning."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have groveled before Kicchou and Kurokoma both,",
                "while only ever thinking about your own benefit."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...How do you know all this?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Haah-hahaha.",
                "What a fun girl you are!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I would have you fulfill a request, should you be able."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That depends. What is it?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After you have accepted doing those beasts' bidding,",
                "you are in no position to refuse mine."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Urgh."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My request is..."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "W-What?",
                "To kill Reimu Hakurei?!"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's... that's a very blunt request."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Will you take it?",
                "Or would you rather wander Hell for all eternity?"
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Muster all your strength and surpass my imagination!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ha. You never could have managed it, regardless."
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can beat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is frustrating..."
            ]
        }
    }
}